    <panel_attributes>title=SD-11 (Stage 2): Run Career Agent Assistant, as implemented
obj=Job Seeker~Seeker
obj=Agent page / CLI~UI
obj=ApiServer~API
obj=AgentController~AC
obj=Planner~PL
obj=ToolRegistry~TR
obj=GeminiClient~GC
obj=MatchJobTool~T

Seeker-&gt;UI : "Match my skills to this job"
UI-&gt;API : POST /api/agent/ask
API-&gt;AC : handle(request)
AC-&gt;PL : plan(request)
PL-&gt;TR : describeAll()
TR.&gt;PL : tool descriptions
PL-&gt;GC : generate(planning prompt)
GC.&gt;PL : raw JSON text
PL-&gt;PL : parse(raw): check JSON, tool name
combinedFragment=break~f1 Seeker,T
Seeker:[response is not valid JSON, has no tool, or names an unknown tool]
PL.&gt;AC : PlanningException
AC.&gt;API : "I could not plan that request: ..."
--=f1
PL.&gt;AC : PlanStep(toolName, args, directAnswer)
combinedFragment=break~f2 Seeker,T
Seeker:[planner chose tool 'none': request can be answered directly]
AC.&gt;API : directAnswer
--=f2
AC-&gt;TR : find(toolName)
TR.&gt;AC : Tool
AC-&gt;T : execute(args)
T-&gt;T : JobMatcher.match(resumeSkills, jobSkills)
T.&gt;AC : result text (or "Tool failed: ..." message)
AC-&gt;GC : generate(request + tool result, "answer only from the result")
GC.&gt;AC : final answer
AC.&gt;API : answer
API.&gt;UI : { "answer": ... }
UI.&gt;Seeker : shows the answer</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes/>
  </element>
</diagram>
